==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{ety|ru|title=шпио́н|:bor|de:Spion}}
{{bor+|ru|de|Spion}}. Omitting several steps, from {{der|ru|gem-pro|*spehōną}}, further from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*speḱ-}}.

Root cognate (via PIE) with {{cog|la|speculātor}}, {{cog|grc|κατάσκοπος}}.

Compare typologically {{m|ru|согляда́тай}} (akin to {{m|ru|гляде́ть}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|шпио́н}}
